{"articleNo":"227567","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=227567&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [한국산업인력공단 국가직무능력표준원] 2019년 NCS기반 능력중심 채용모델 교육·콘텐츠 제공 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.08.05","hit":"8971","attachments":[{"name":"2019년도 능력중심 채용모델 제공 안내문(교육).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=227567&attachNo=81769"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">한국산업인력공단에서는 능력중심사회 구현의 일환으로, 공정한 채용 문화 정착을 위한 </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">『능력중심 채용모델 개발 및 확산』사업을 추진하고 있습니다. 이와 관련, 블라인드 채용 등 변화하는 채용 문화에 대응할 수 있도록 정책수요자 대상 </span><span style=\"font-family: verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>맞춤형 교육 및 콘텐츠를 제공</strong></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">하고 있음을 알려드리오니 활용 바랍니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>1. 지원시기</strong></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> : 2019. 8. 1.(목) ~ 2019. 11. 29.(금)</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>2. 예산사항</strong></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> : 공단 전액 부담 원칙</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움,dotum; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>3. 지원내용</strong></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> : 취업준비생</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">·인사담당자·면접관 교육, 평가 문항 제공</span></p><!--StartFragment--><table width=\"791\" style=\"border: currentColor; border-image: none; width: 791px; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; mso-table-overlap: never;\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 102.28pt; height: 32px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 140%; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">구    분</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 509px; height: 32px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 140%; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">주요 지원내용</span></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 102.28pt; height: 32px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 140%; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">채용모델 콘텐츠</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 509px; height: 32px;\"><p class=\"0\" style